  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Better Access to Treatment for Paediatric MDR-TB</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to increase the number of children with MDR-TB treated with better medicines resulting in reduced morbidity and mortality through addressing the remaining persistent knowledge gaps on TB drug PK in children and the development of appropriate formulations of drugs used for MDR-TB treatment.</narrative>
  </description>
